designer
========

This skill is an independent, clean-room implementation inspired by the concept
of "Impeccable" by Paul Bakaus (https://impeccable.style). No code or content
was copied from that project: this implementation was written from scratch
based on independent analysis of publicly documented concepts and factual
detector thresholds. We thank the original author for popularizing the
anti-slop detector + design-direction pattern for coding agents.

All code and data in this repository is original work.
